    sh:description "An ObservationCollection may reference at most one SiteVisit. Protocols that are always carried out during a site visit constrain this further in their own shapes." ;
    sh:maxCount 1 ;
    sh:message "A `tern:ObservationCollection` _MAY_ have a maximum of 1 `tern:hasSiteVisit` predicate with an IRI value of type `tern:SiteVisit`." ;
